  "body": "## Summary\n\n- remove the scheduled SQLite snapshot generator, committed database, sql.js/WASM runtime, and browser snapshot context\n- send all public reads through the same-origin AKS API while authentication resolves independently\n- harden stale Vite asset handling with non-cacheable HTML, real static 404s, one-time tab recovery, and single-replica Recreate rollouts\n- document the decision and the existing Cosmos DB Continuous backup policy\n\n## Verification\n\n- frontend: npm run lint\n- frontend: npm run build\n- backend: node syntax checks\n- backend: npm run migrate:dry-run\n- helm template kill-me ./k8s\n- local Express route, MIME, and headless-browser smoke tests\n- live Azure read confirmed infra-cosmos-serverless uses Continuous backup",
